§8Hello my dear readers! Thank you for your continued support with my magazines, much like my own sanity, I can't quite believe it's still here. These books have gone a long way, more than I ever thought! I'm sure there's no plot holes.
#- §8When I began this adventure I did not have CEO's, scientists, robots, dragons, multiple storylines and realms, time travel, §70010110§r, a mysterious §8island, suspious soup, Fern & having a crush on a villager called 'test subject pete' and also kinda with an ancient enitity inside the book itself...§§
#- §8Those just happened!

And in a strange way, I'm really happy they did, cause the story is 10x better this way ;)

So a big thank you again and I wish you all a wonderfull...§r

