#- §9╔═.✵.════════╗§r
   §1 Wish On A Star!§r
§9╚════════.✵.═╝§r
§8"To fully appreciate the beauty of a snowflake, it is necessary to stand out in the cold"§r 
§7- Aristotle§r

§3We find ourselves here. Last xmas was meant to be our last xmas. So now what?§r
#- §3Has§r The Darkness §3given up? Is it leaving us alone? Can we enjoy life the way it's meant to be enjoyed?
If one life is all we get, it makes life all the more special right? If we just reset and begin again then where is the value in it all? Is this our 222th xmas? More? Who knows?§r
#- §3I want to relax. I want to enjoy my life. 

I want to settle down. Live in a cute witches cottage somewhere with a huge garden and a book shop. I want my friends to be with me, and even§r §5ɨȶ§r. I §3want§r §5ɨȶ§r §3to live with me forever, as my friend, perhaps more. Can I still have all that?§r
#- §3We all should have what we want, without the fear of§r §0Darkness§r §3looming over us.§r 

§3Maybe this time is not the same? Maybe we are free now? It's not come yet so why would it now? We can only hope... I guess that is what Christmas is all about... hope. The§r §6Star§r §3Card in tarot right?§r
#- §3How can I call myself§r §6'Star'§r §3and not enjoy xmas... or not have hope in my heart? 

It's been a crazy year. So much has happened and so much is not answered yet. We need more time! People wish on a§r §6Star§r. §3My wish is more time. I wish I could give everyone more time.§r
#- §3This page is 2222. 
They say the angel number 2222 means big live changes. A reset would be just that, can't get much more of a change. Death and then rebirth. When you see 222 it's a sign to not lose hope. Typical. 
I'm more of a 1111 person myself... 
Or was that§r §70010110§r?
#- §3Why do I get so scared each time winter comes? Is it because of the cold and§r §0dark§r? Reminding §3me of the thing we fear in the shadows...§r
