§cXmas is the perfect time for shopping! 
So let me talk about Newport, created by Werkmeneer. You find yourself in a modern set of store plots, with beautiful blossom trees framing the long road down. The style of this shop layout
#- §cand outside exterior are so well made. You can buy here. A shop of note is /warp Ghounds, rated best shop by many. Including myself. ;)
You can see some empty stores, but you can also tell how much work went into this whole place. They have a very cute beach area.§r
#- §cA great way to make use of the summer items! Maybe not right now, as it's very cold.

Overall, I think this area is great and worth a visit.§r

