#- §2"To Sweetpea, my mother Marigold, left behind one last spell before she died. I hope the spell worked & the gift found you, at least before 'you know what' does. It's been on a long journey but i'm sure if broken, you can fix it, you always do. The necklace served me well & in my old age,§r
